Package: datasinking
Type: Package
Title: Access Full-Text Financial Reports as Markdown
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("DataSinking", "Team", email = "support@datasink.ing",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A client for the DataSinking API (<https://datasink.ing>), which
    turns full-text financial reports (annual, semi-annual and quarterly
    filings across the US, UK, China, Japan, Korea, Taiwan and more) into
    clean, section-addressable Markdown. Provides functions to list exchanges
    and stocks, search documents, and retrieve full report text or individual
    sections such as MD&A, risk factors and footnotes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    httr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://datasink.ing, https://github.com/heubme2020/datasinking
BugReports: https://github.com/heubme2020/datasinking/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Config/testthat/edition: 3
